                        "sense_id": "8728b57d-31f2-3246-bbbf-fc85f40ecf0c",
                        "entry_id": "0037798f-d950-34d7-a9a8-91dd7eb68315",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Angry or surly, sulky."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Northern-US"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d424c4e4-1635-4567-ae26-028d6e581229",
                                "sense_id": "8728b57d-31f2-3246-bbbf-fc85f40ecf0c",
                                "text": "How easy to be kind and pleasant: how uncomfortable to be rude and grouty!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca9ec26f-40f5-4bf2-ae91-a77a173e36fa",
                                "sense_id": "8728b57d-31f2-3246-bbbf-fc85f40ecf0c",
                                "text": "You better go down to your company, or that long-nosed Englishwoman'll get even groutier than she is."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a192c4f5-b03e-4e67-8797-7773df6e6a4d",
                                "sense_id": "8728b57d-31f2-3246-bbbf-fc85f40ecf0c",
                                "text": "Amanda was fuming. […] But then, the telltale grappling and stumble step backward—thump—against the wall, which braced them through the ensuing make-out moment, however brief, until the grouty girl could be heard cooing with pleasure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "afaed425-93a3-4c7f-a290-276993099896",
                                "sense_id": "8728b57d-31f2-3246-bbbf-fc85f40ecf0c",
                                "text": "Though I suppose if you've no one to love but a grouty old mother, you don't have the worry and fear for your menfolk heavy on you, Mercy conceded."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
